bareframe zsh shell integration

zsh/.zshenv and zsh/ghostty-integration are copied unchanged from Ghostty's
shell integration (vendor/gpui-libghostty/crates/gpui-ghostty/vendor/ghostty/
src/shell-integration/zsh). They are based on Kitty's zsh integration and are
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later. The full
license text is in COPYING next to this file.

bareframe starts zsh with ZDOTDIR pointing at the zsh directory. The .zshenv
there restores the user's ZDOTDIR, sources the user's own startup files and
loads ghostty-integration, which reports prompts and command boundaries with
OSC 133 and the working directory with OSC 7.
